<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 300s</p><h1 class="research-title">The 4th century</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 300s, 193 states of the register existed somewhere in the world. 50 were founded and 54 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Roman Empire, the Sasanian Empire and the Roman Egypt.</p></header>
